town because of one person?

512
00:28:29,420 --> 00:28:30,897
That's how Arlong rules.

513
00:28:30,980 --> 00:28:35,417
To them we're nothing but a subspecies,
so killing us has always been easy.

514
00:28:35,500 --> 00:28:39,700
You pathetic humans need to stop
with all this thinking you're up to.

515
00:28:40,000 --> 00:28:41,647
It's your greatest weakness.

516
00:28:42,500 --> 00:28:45,500
I'm allowing you to
contribute to greatness here.

517
00:28:46,100 --> 00:28:48,057
Soon, Fistman will conquer the humans,

518
00:28:48,140 --> 00:28:50,677
and your tributes will be a small part of

519
00:28:50,760 --> 00:28:53,380
the beginning of the
glorious Arlong Empire!

520
00:28:55,760 --> 00:28:57,040
Arlong Empire?

521
00:28:58,260 --> 00:29:01,700
They're planning on taking
over the entire East Blue!

522
00:29:23,080 --> 00:29:24,580
Get out of here quick.

523
00:29:25,100 --> 00:29:26,747
Arlong's gonna be back soon.

524
00:30:05,540 --> 00:30:12,437
I began to wonder what could be
the reason it's so hot inside?

525
00:30:12,520 --> 00:30:18,617
No answer has come, but I can't
get away from what's true!

526
00:30:18,700 --> 00:30:21,160
It's because of you.

527
00:30:24,020 --> 00:30:28,757
Show me how to catch those feelings,
get them to come back to me?

528
00:30:28,840 --> 00:30:33,797
I'll do what I must be, cause
they're everything I want to be.

529
00:30:33,880 --> 00:30:38,417
Pass these arms around my dreams
and pull up back from yesterday.

530
00:30:38,500 --> 00:30:43,820
If I'm holding hands with you,
I'm sure that we can make the way!
